        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;My dream is to be a film director.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About &quot;Blue Hawaii Aniki's Soft Ore Demand DEBUT&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Blue Hawaii Aniki's Soft Ore Demand DEBUT&quot; is a short visual novel modeled after a late-night variety show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Blue Hawaii Aniki,&quot; who just sleeps in his bed, dreams of being a film director.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A self-proclaimed master director appears on a B-grade late-night variety show to earn a little extra cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Blue Hawaii Aniki's Soft Ore Demand&quot; is a B-grade late-night variety show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With social satire, silly plot twists, and a nostalgic yet silly feel, this &quot;TV-like&quot; feel is fully realized in the form of a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the debut title in the upcoming Blue Hawaii Aniki series. It includes several segments and is expected to last approximately one hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game recommended for those looking to relax and laugh.</p>",
